<article class="env-lemma" id="0E03">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0E03">Lemma <span data-tag="0E03">72.11.5</span>.</a> Let $k$ be a field of characteristic $p > 0$. Let $X$ be an algebraic space over $k$. The following are equivalent </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
$X$ is geometrically reduced over $k$, 
</p>
</li><li><p>
$X_{k'}$ is reduced for every field extension $k'/k$, 
</p>
</li><li><p>
$X_{k'}$ is reduced for every finite purely inseparable field extension $k'/k$, 
</p>
</li><li><p>
$X_{k^{1/p}}$ is reduced, 
</p>
</li><li><p>
$X_{k^{perf}}$ is reduced, and 
</p>
</li><li><p>
$X_{\bar k}$ is reduced. 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Choose a surjective étale morphism $U \to X$ where $U$ is a scheme. Via Lemma <a href="/tag/0DMS" data-tag="0DMS">72.11.3</a> the lemma follows from the result for $U$ over $k$. See Varieties, Lemma <a href="/tag/035X" data-tag="035X">33.6.4</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>